  "__html": "  <section class=\"usage-comparison shell\" id=\"compare\" aria-labelledby=\"compare-title\">\n    <div class=\"compare-heading\"><div><p class=\"pricing-kicker\">把额度换成看得见的成果</p><h2 id=\"compare-title\">能做多少，一目了然</h2></div><a href=\"#plan-benefits\">对比会员权益 ↓</a></div>\n    <div class=\"usage-tabs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"生成类型\"><button type=\"button\" data-usage-kind=\"image\" aria-pressed=\"true\">图片生成</button><button type=\"button\" data-usage-kind=\"video\" aria-pressed=\"false\">视频生成</button></div>\n    <div class=\"usage-calculator\">\n      <div class=\"usage-controls\">\n        <label>模型<select id=\"usage-model\"></select></label>\n        <label><span id=\"usage-spec-label\">规格</span><select id=\"usage-spec\"></select></label>\n        <label class=\"usage-cost\"><span id=\"usage-cost-label\">试算单价 · Credits / 张</span><input id=\"usage-cost\" type=\"number\" min=\"0.001\" max=\"1000000000\" step=\"any\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"填写单次扣点\"></label>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"usage-rate-note\" id=\"usage-rate-note\">正式模型扣点待公布。可填入单价试算，不代表平台报价。</p>\n      <div class=\"usage-results\" id=\"usage-results\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n      <div class=\"usage-calculation-note\"><span id=\"usage-formula\">可生成数量 = 可用额度 ÷ 单张扣点，向下取整。</span><span>各档为独立估算，不可相加</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <details class=\"usage-details\"><summary>查看模型规格与计费口径 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">＋</span></summary><div class=\"usage-table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"模型规格与计费说明\"><table class=\"usage-model-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">模型</th><th scope=\"col\">规格口径</th><th scope=\"col\">计费单位</th><th scope=\"col\">当前状态</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"usage-model-rows\"></tbody></table></div><p>规格是用于测算的参数，实际开放能力以模型目录为准。尺寸、质量、时长、音频和参考素材均可能影响消耗；Agent 规划、重试及编辑会另有用量。</p></details>\n    <p class=\"usage-footnote\">Free 按当日 100 点计算；付费档按每月包含额度计算，不叠加每日赠送或另购余额。每一项都假设额度仅用于当前模型，不是额外赠送的图片或视频配额。</p>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"benefit-comparison shell\" id=\"plan-benefits\" aria-labelledby=\"benefit-compare-title\">\n    <div class=\"compare-heading\"><div><p class=\"pricing-kicker\">额度之外，也说清楚</p><h2 id=\"benefit-compare-title\">会员权益对比</h2></div><a href=\"#rules\">完整规则 ↓</a></div>\n    <div class=\"benefit-table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"各档会员权益，可横向滚动\"><table class=\"benefit-table\"><caption class=\"sr-only\">Free、Core、Plus、Pro 与 Max 的额度、并发和使用权益</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">权益</th><th scope=\"col\">Free<small>无需订阅</small></th><th scope=\"col\">Core<small>¥29 / 月</small></th><th scope=\"col\">Plus<small>¥69 / 月</small></th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"compare-pro\">Pro<small>¥129 / 月</small></th><th scope=\"col\">Max<small>¥229 / 月</small></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"benefit-comparison-rows\"></tbody></table></div>\n    <div class=\"benefit-notes\"><p><strong>并发不等于生成速度</strong>同时处理更多任务，不代表单个模型更快；生成耗时取决于模型、规格与实时负载。</p><p><strong>商用不等于无条件授权</strong>需符合所选模型与输入素材的授权条件；具体范围以正式条款为准。</p></div>\n  </section>\n"
